#####################
# DESPESAS (EXPENSES)
#####################

### Criar Despesa
POST http://localhost:3333/api/expenses HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no shopping",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "expenseDate": "2026-01-30",
  "walletId": "fa13cab2-ae73-423c-a11a-0b410c5399e5",
  "categoryId": "9892366f-41fc-4c96-9935-f00c06327d71",
  "isRecurring": false
}

###
### Listar Despesas por Mês
# Requer: walletId, month, year como query params
GET http://localhost:3333/api/expenses?walletId=fa13cab2-ae73-423c-a11a-0b410c5399e5&month=1&year=2026 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Atualizar Despesa
# Substitua EXPENSE_ID pelo ID da despesa criada
PUT http://localhost:3333/api/expenses/50208a94-dc60-4ce7-ae9d-26ddea9d9656 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante (atualizado) 2",
  "amount": 50.00
}

###
### Buscar Despesa por ID
GET http://localhost:3333/api/expenses/50208a94-dc60-4ce7-ae9d-26ddea9d9656 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Deletar Despesa
# Substitua EXPENSE_ID pelo ID da despesa
DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/expenses/1d219d93-9996-4a22-b72f-13be41c0d8ce HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

