Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trend Stats
GET http://localhost:3333/api/stats/trends?walletId=fa13cab2-ae73-423c-a11a-0b410c5399e5&limit=6 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comparison Stats
GET http://localhost:3333/api/stats/comparison?walletId=fa13cab2-ae73-423c-a11a-0b410c5399e5&month=1&year=2026 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

